# Per docs/rules/git-rules.md — every PR requires review from someone
# outside the PR's author; this file is a starting point, not a
# substitute for that rule. Update the placeholder team handles once real
# team assignments exist.

# Architecture and rules documents require Architecture Review Board review
# per docs/governance/architecture-governance.md.
/docs/architecture/ @itsm/architecture-review-board
/docs/adr/ @itsm/architecture-review-board
/CLAUDE.md @itsm/architecture-review-board

# Security-sensitive code requires security review per
# docs/rules/security-rules.md.
/src/Platform/Platform.Infrastructure/ @itsm/security-review
/src/BuildingBlocks/Tenancy/ @itsm/security-review

# Database migrations touching shared/tenant-scoped tables require a
# second reviewer per docs/rules/database-rules.md.
/src/**/Migrations/ @itsm/architecture-review-board

# Default owner for everything else — replace with the real platform team.
* @itsm/platform-team
